--- !u!114 &316241203
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 316241202}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7a051f7cf7518c4287dc1c75bb8eea4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 1545443496}
  lines:
  - Wait just a measure, boy!
  - "I need to say something to ya\u2019"
  - "If you haven\u2019t noticed yet\u2026"
  - "Haydn my boy, I\u2019m on death\u2019s door"
  - "I\u2019ve lived my whole, long life in the outskirts"
  - "I\u2019ve seen countless settlements be destroyed by the percussionists"
  - And I can tell you with certainty that Trill is the last remaining human settlement
  - "And they\u2019ll come for us too"
  - "They\u2019ll take us and turn us into half instrument- half people abominations"
  - "We\u2019ll lose our humanity"
  - All of us will
  - "And I don\u2019t want to be around for the extinction of humankind"
  - So please, Haydn
  - Fight against the percussionists for as long as you can
  - "Yeah\u2026"
  - "Anyways, why don\u2019t you go get me some food?"
  - "Do a dying man a favor and snag me my favorite, will ya\u2019?"
  - The pear trees are deep in the outskirts, so make sure to pull up your map with
    Tab to not get lost
  - Good luck!
  textSpeed: 0.05
