  textComponent: {fileID: 1426293066}
  lines:
  - "What\u2019s up Haydn?"
  - Did you fish up any food?
  - ...
  - "That\u2019s fine"
  - "I\u2019ll eat tomorrow"
  - Or maybe the day after that
  - Or the day after that
  - Or I could just lie down and accept my fate
  - ...
  - Please leave me to my misery
  - Using the arrow keys to walk away, I mean
  textSpeed: 0.05
