  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 72181308}
  lines:
  - Hey
  - You going out into the outskirts today?
  - Stay safe
  - If you see any wild beasts, make sure to give them a whack with the "S" key
  - Good thing that instrument weapon washed up on the shore
  - Works much better than a wooden plank
  - ...
  - "But if you can\u2019t fight for whatever reason\u2026"
  - "Just dash away with the \u201CD\u201D key"
  textSpeed: 0.05
